with the module a relying party imports.

Ported and vendored components:

  * attestation/
      ported from Super-Protocol/swarm-cloud `libs/swarm-attestation`, which is
      licensed under the Business Source License 1.1. The port under the Apache
      License 2.0 was explicitly authorised by the copyright holder. It is the
      verifier of the `/.well-known/swarm-evidence` contract: certificate chain,
      trusted-root match, JWS, freshness and channel binding.

  * attestation/attestedroot/internal/azurecvm/
      a verbatim copy of Super-Protocol/sp-nodejs-addons
      `attestation-wasm/go/azurecvm` — the Azure confidential-VM verifier the
      browser extension's WebAssembly build runs. Kept byte-identical to
      upstream so that both derive the same mrEnclave from the same root; see
      that directory's README.

  * attestation/attestedroot/internal/snpmeasure/
      the SEV-SNP launch-digest calculation, ported from Super-Protocol/sp-sev
      `snp_calc_launch_digest_with_hashes_from_bytes`.

The repository's own NOTICE records every other port in
Super-Protocol/confidential-router.
